      "writtenOn": "2020-05-30T18:24:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "iiuc, TPM register access is processed in interrupt handler, and TPM command is processed in TPM task.\n\nThis is the call path for TPM_BOARD_CFG write:\n\n_sps0_interrupt()/_sps0_cs_deassert_interrupt() -\u003e sps_cs_deassert_interrupt()\n-\u003e sps_rx_interrupt()\n-\u003e sps_rx_handler(), which is tpm_rx_handler()\n-\u003e process_rx_data()\n-\u003e board_cfg_reg_write_()\nboard_cfg_reg_write()",
